    "Prior to the commencement of works at the site a Dust Management Plan must be\rsubmitted to and approved in writing by the local planning authority. The DMP must\rinclude monitoring of dust deposition, dust flux, real-time PM10 continuous monitoring\rand/or visual inspections. This plan must incorporate the recommendations of (Table 9:\rMitigation Measures to be Incorporated into the DMP/ CEMP for the Proposed\rDevelopment) of the Air Quality Assessment and be in compliance with the GLA Control\rof Dust and Emissions during Construction and Demolition SPG.\r\rReason: To comply with Policy SI1 of the London Plan 2021 and Policy 34 of the Sutton\rLocal Plan 2018"
